        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.109,
            0.62,
            0.688,
            0.656
          ],
          "content": "Thus the water molecule formed is represented as $\\mathrm { H _ { 2 } O , }$ which indicates the presence of two hydrogen atoms and one oxygen atom."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.752,
